WEBVTT

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.270
Welcome to my castle!

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.650
The Ocean Puzzle here is able to move
because of the Chaos energy

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:21.020
from these writhing, struggling travelers!

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.680
This cube was constructed as a collection
of pieces of various worlds.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:30.360
I told them that they would find the exit after
they cleared the attraction in each cube...

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.120
But that was a bold-faced lie!

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:37.130
They are nothing but the energy unit
for enlarging Chaos,

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.800
and for operating the Ocean Puzzle
until Omega is found.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.070
As soon as I no longer need them,
I will feed them to Chaos!

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:49.570
What pitiful fools!

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:25.240
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:25.240
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:32.750
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:32.750
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:41.860
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:41.860
With our eyes on the future

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:47.960
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:47.960
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:57.600
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:57.600
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:05.110
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:05.110
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:10.820
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:10.820
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:20.320
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:20.320
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:33.180
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:38.880
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.560
Gaudium, the stronghold of the skies...

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:47.020
Yu and Earl Tyrant...

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:53.130
The most unwelcome sight of those
he wanted to see the most...

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:59.640
Awaiting them in the next cube
of the Ocean Puzzle is...

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.240
You're giving up?

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:16.750
Yeah, because no matter how advanced Jane is,
she still can't run over sand.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:21.890
So we have no choice but to drift aimlessly
around in this quicksand here?

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:26.360
We have to figure out how to get
to the next cube somehow.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:32.710
It's so hot. Is there no
air conditioning in this place?

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:38.870
Hey, Yu, what's wrong?
You don't seem very happy.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:44.290
<i>That must have been some kind of
misunderstanding.</i>

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:45.850
<i>I'm sure of it.</i>

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:50.180
<i>Dad... Mom...</i>

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.350
<i>White Cloud...</i>

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:01.140
I've got it, why don't you eat some Chocobu?

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.470
That'll cheer you up.

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.210
I'll ask Poshepocket.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:09.330
Chocobu, bui, bui, let's go Chocobu!

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:17.280
What's this?

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:22.750
It looks like a cactus, but...

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.240
Ouch!

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.760
I'll get you!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.540
Was he just...

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.240
Was he laughing?

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:55.550
Stop!

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.290
Chobi, grab him!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:23.210
Chobi, are you okay?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:25.480
He won't get away with this!

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:47.230
How weird.

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:52.240
He's over here!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.780
Grab him!

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:57.810
He's getting away again!

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.250
Stop!

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.890
What was that thing?

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:12.090
That made this soap taste so good!

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.110
What was that?

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.710
That was a cactus.

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:31.880
Excuse me!

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:34.520
A cactus?

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.400
It certainly looks like a cactus, doesn't it?

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.560
I'll get him this time.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.030
All right!

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:20.400
I knew you could do it, Lisa!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.130
You're not getting away now!

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:37.880
He got away.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.690
He's so fast.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:41.780
I'll catch him if it's the last thing I do!

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:49.030
Stop!

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:57.670
He came from you, so you need to take
some responsibility and get him! Okay?!

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.210
All right!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.580
Sis!

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:06.140
Wait, Ai! It's dangerous!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.550
It looks like there's a gap in the
quicksand up ahead.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:19.220
Hey, what are they doing outside?!

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.530
There's something strange about this desert.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:34.040
It feels like something has taken
all the life from this place.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.700
It's as still as death.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:40.810
Hurry up! Over here!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.630
There's so many of them!

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:16.010
<i>This is bad. We'll never be able to
escape this many of them.</i>

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:18.340
<i>I've got to protect the twins somehow.</i>

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:25.750
Hold on a minute. We're not your enemies.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:30.390
So why don't we all just get along?

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:00.890
I'm showing traces of a strong
distortion of space in this area.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:03.590
I can't really get a feel on anything.

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:10.630
It seems like all life here has been
sucked into a cold darkness.

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:16.710
Yeah, these Cactuar were attacked
by the Wandering Sea.

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.110
Cactuar?

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:20.480
Yeah, these guys are called Cactuar.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.340
Do you understand their speech?

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.380
I think I pretty much understand them.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:32.360
There used to be many more Cactuar
that lived in this desert.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:43.530
But one day the Wandering Sea suddenly came
and destroyed their home.

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:48.280
They made their escape underground,

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:53.740
but they long to once again live in the sun,
and defeat the Wandering Sea!

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.380
That's right, we mustn't fail!

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:03.750
We've got to build a world where
peace and order are maintained!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.760
We, the Comodeen, will help you.

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.160
We will defeat the Wandering Sea!

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.430
Ouch!

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:17.440
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.560
Well, I have no objections.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.940
We cannot allow anything to attack
a people living in peace.

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:31.880
I think the dimensional distortion in this area
is because of that Wandering Sea.

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.390
We might be able to move on
to the next cube if we destroy it.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:37.220
Really?

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:40.590
All right, let's go for it, everyone!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.150
Okay!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.260
What are they doing?

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:58.510
They say they're digging a hole
to trap the Wandering Sea in.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:04.910
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.320
I'm getting a horribly eerie feeling.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:12.120
The Wandering Sea is headed for us.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:19.670
<i>It's coming.</i>

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.940
The high powered dryer, Marianne,

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.700
and the drainage pump, Cordelia.

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:27.810
If we combine your powers
and incorporate Kaoruko,

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.110
the high-powered battery, on top of that...

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.810
Hey, wait, this unit is...

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.820
I told you that doesn't go over there!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:40.410
No, no, come back here!

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.890
Chobi, it's all right!

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:48.100
Hey, you!

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.290
Chobi!

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:52.330
I can hear voices.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:56.400
The voices of evil spirits who hate the living.

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:01.740
The souls of those who lost their lives
in the sea have gathered

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.810
and have become an enormous energy.

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:07.510
Together they are the Wandering Sea.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:12.150
I'd like to cure them with the Kigen Arts, but...

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:27.130
I'm starting to really feel the creeps.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.010
It's here.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:33.300
Comodeen, prepare for battle!

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:38.400
Prepare to fire the big arrow
filled with drying agent!

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.730
That's the Wandering Sea.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:05.430
I've got it in my sights!

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:08.130
Take in a deep, strong breath!

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.750
Fire the drying agent cannon!

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:15.480
Exhale!

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:30.660
It's no use!

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:33.590
<i>The spirit of overflowing water...</i>

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.930
I knew it, there's no spiritual
reaction whatsoever.

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:47.740
Marianne! Cordelia! Kaoruko! Go!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.980
I'm counting on you guys!

00:14:59.860 --> 00:15:00.790
My babies!

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:04.750
It's no use! All hands abandon Jane
and take refuge!

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:15.230
Is everyone here?

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:16.580
What about Lisa?

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:18.310
Is she still down there?

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:21.950
Lisa! Hurry up and get out of there!

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:26.220
Kaze...

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:30.960
It has moved.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.290
Chobi! Go get Lisa!

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:36.350
Wait! It looks like Mister is going
to use the Magun.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.760
Soil is my power!

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.890
The Magun has thawed!

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:24.710
The appropriate Soil to use against
you has been decided!

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:32.110
Grinding up and eating rocks,
Shark Gray!

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:41.920
The one that drinks up thirst,
Water Blue!

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:50.670
And finally, the one that can even chew
on empty space, Crusher White!

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:04.380
Roar! I summon you, Bismarck!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:28.740
Wow!

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:38.750
It was so close!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.780
His Summon totally disappeared!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:45.850
The Cactuar?!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.160
When did they?!

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:04.700
That light...

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.810
It's the Cactuars' life energy.

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.840
It looks just like a dryer, doesn't it?

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:17.760
Almost there.

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:18.850
You can do it!

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:32.730
The energy of the wandering dead has been
defeated by the energy of the living!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:34.900
But...

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.840
What a horrible tragedy!

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:45.410
Even though they finally took the
desert back as their own...

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:48.980
They said they wanted to live
under the sun once again.

00:18:51.890 --> 00:18:55.450
The least we can do is give them a proper burial

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.820
in the desert that they protected with their lives.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.920
They really are still alive!

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:17.850
No way!

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:18.750
How?

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:27.620
They're saying they've been revived because
they've been dried to the core by the sunlight.

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:41.630
I'm detecting a distortion of space!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.840
I think the Ocean Puzzle will be moving
in about ten minutes.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:48.080
Comodeen, man your positions!

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:51.540
Shall we go?

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:57.590
And thanks for helping out today.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:05.970
Before, when I said you didn't act human...

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.260
I'm sorry about that.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:12.830
I know that you've been through
a lot of hard times too.

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:21.210
<i>This man, perhaps more than anyone else,
knows the importance of life.</i>

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:24.210
<i>More than anyone...</i>

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express passes through the night

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express hashirisaru

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Riding into the distance

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Toorisugiru yakei ni

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Let me hear more of your heart

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Motto kokoro kikasete

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Let me close my eyes and be intoxicated

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Hitomi tojite yowasete

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Only the two of us are being taken

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Futari dake wo tsurete ku

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
On this trip that we began with nothing but love

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
Ai dake tsurete tabidatsu

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.600
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.600
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Bring your tired heart

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:10.300
Tsukareta sono kokoro wo

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.850
Romancing train, whistle again

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.850
Romancing train, whistle again

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.150
It embraces me softly

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.150
Yasashiku daite kureru

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.050
And I know that there is love here

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.050
Ai ga koko ni aru koto

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:30.350
Whisper into my ear until I fall asleep

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:30.350
Nemuru made mimimoto de sasayaite ite

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.550
Clouds hang low deep in the night
as the moonlight shines through

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.550
Moonlight terasu shinya no
tachikomeru hikui cloud

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.950
I can almost touch it if I reach out,
flying higher than ever

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.950
Kono te nobaseba todokisou
tsukinukete maiagaru hodo

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.650
Yeah, I turn the pages of my book softly
so as not to awaken you

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.650
Yeah yawaraka ni nemuru
kimi okosanai you ni mekuru

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.300
The old words in the paperback
tell a tale of romance

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.300
Paperback furui kotoba tsuzurareta romance

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.050
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.050
Romancing train, bring all the pain

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.800
It moves onward with grace

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.800
Susunde yuku yuuga ni

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.400
On the romancing train

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.400
Romancing train futari wa

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.650
Together we seek out beauty

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:01.650
Utsukushisa wo motomete

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:07.450
Love is watching our dreams

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:07.450
Ai wa yume wo mite iru

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.430
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:24.560
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:27.200
There's nothing like the good old days.

00:22:27.770 --> 00:22:30.270
Everyone looks back at the past,

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:36.010
and the travelers fall into a world to which
they never should have been able to return.

00:22:40.890 --> 00:22:43.880
Next time, I'll return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
